Add android_text_Hyphenator to libandroid_runtime for host

Upstream: platform/frameworks/base commit 9a629e24776, adapted to r1

Why: the official library has the Hyphenator table and the string
ro.hyphen.data.dir. Adapted: MappedFile form kept, no trace calls in this
file at r1.

